{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_08_beg","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_07_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-8","storyName":"金玉藏心\n","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"小大厨给煌端上了一道特制的桔红酥，煌终于拼凑出自己身世的全部真相。另一方面，宁述来到大理寺，向狱中的虞澄坦白了四十年前旧案的一切。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_08_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["顾筌","小大厨","小厨子","宁述","宁府管家","宁府杂役","宁茵","监狱卫兵A","监狱卫兵B","谌彻","戴面具的人","麟青砚","？？？","解真","煌","虞澄"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#9$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"要一份桔红酥......打包带走。","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"哟，来啦。","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"这次还是寄去维多利亚吗？","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"不......不寄了。我马上就要回去了......能不能回去，也不好说就是了。","id":18},{"type":"multiline","name":"顾筌","text":"这次——","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#2$1","id":21},{"type":"multiline","name":"顾筌","end":"true","text":"咳咳，咳咳咳！就打包一份点心，路上吃。","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#8$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"哎哎，怎么咳成了这样。","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我看你还是别吃甜食了，我给你熬一碗枇杷水喝吧。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#2$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"没事......没事......不是肺上的毛病。","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"不管哪里的病都要注意啊，看过大夫了吗？","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#9$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"看过，看过了。大夫说，我活不了多久啦。","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"想吃点啥，也不用忌口了。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#10$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小厨子","text":"......啊？","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#9$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"没事，没事......人总有一死嘛。","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"我要做的事，差不多也都做完了......","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#10$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"怎......怎么可以有这种念头！","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你不是说......你在维多利亚还有家人，她......她们还在等你回家啊。","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#9$1","id":42},{"type":"multiline","name":"顾筌","text":"是啊......我也盼着，能再见她们一面，但想必是","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#2$1","id":45},{"type":"multiline","name":"顾筌","end":"true","text":"咳咳......不能如愿了......","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"我此生虽然一事无成，但自以为没有愧对过心中那一点理想、道义。","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"可到头才发现，对她们，我实在亏欠太多......","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#11$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"嗐......人不就是这样，哪有碟子不磕着碗的？一个人要是打心眼里觉得自己对得起所有人，那才叫没心没肺呢。","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#12$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"就算这样，你也不能就不打算回家去了呀？","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#2$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"我想见她们，但是不见，可以让她们活得更好。","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"人不就这样......总得放下点什么，才能成全点什么。","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"他们都放下了，我也该放下了......","id":56},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#9$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"小大厨，这些年多受你照顾，连最后这点大梦呓语，也只能说给你听了。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#12$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"那你......","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你还有......什么愿望吗？","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#1$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"顾筌","text":"我的愿望......","id":65},{"type":"dialog","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":71},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":72},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sweep","volume":"1","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkingstick_slow","volume":"1","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"仔细点，都仔细点。看看你扫过的这地，全是灰。","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"那些边边角角的地方都别漏了，脏东西都打扫干净。要搬走了，也别给这屋子后来的主人留麻烦。","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府管家","text":"老爷，都这么晚了，您上哪去啊？","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#5$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"没事，别管我，我就出去散散步。","id":83},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkingstick_slow","volume":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府杂役","text":"宁大人今天真奇怪。","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府杂役","text":"这中秋节，不待在屋里赏月，怎么监督起我们搞卫生了。","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府管家","text":"别想了，专心扫你的地。","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府管家","text":"今晚月亮把这儿照得这么敞亮，地上的事也给它打扫干净些。","id":91},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sweep","volume":"1","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_bg_bg_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":100},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我怎么......在这......","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"爷爷的书房？","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":107},{"type":"text","text":"脑袋又昏又沉，自己好像忘记了什么重要的事。","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"一本陈旧的书册，静静躺在案头。","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"《炎史一百廿四卷十七策补》......1062年......太史阁里哪里有这一卷？","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......爷爷？","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监狱卫兵A","text":"这第五层的监狱多久没关过犯人了，今晚进来的这位，什么来头？","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监狱卫兵B","text":"御前行刺，被禁军亲手逮回来的。","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监狱卫兵A","text":"这么狠——！","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监狱卫兵B","text":"嘘！","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监狱卫兵B","text":"别多想，别多问，看紧就是了。出了半点差错，你我加起来都不够顶。","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_doorclose","volume":"1","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cavewaterdrop","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":126},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":127,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"从我回到百灶起，遇上的每件事都像是安排好的。","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"摆在我面前的一系列线索像是诱饵，最终都指向一个死局。","id":131},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"background","id":138},{"type":"image","image":"58_i05","screenadapt":"coverall","id":139},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":140},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谌彻","text":"作案者不仅武功高强，还对大理寺相当熟悉，而且一定与虞澄早有串联......","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谌彻","text":"虞澄指名要让你来做审决他时的笔录，这是你现在站在这里的原因，也是我不能让你进一步参与的原因。","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谌彻","text":"不管虞澄有什么谋划，你一定是其中的一环。","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"image","id":151},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"......麟少卿既然问出了这样的问题，心里难道没有答案？","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"麟少卿到底是看不到真相，还是因为不敢看，才假装看不到？","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"image","id":162},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"解真御史为何偏偏对虞澄的案件如此上心？","id":166},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":171},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":172},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":175},{"type":"text","text":"月渐西沉，月光越过铁窗，洒在一方囚室，夜气凝露，打在麟青砚的眉心。","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"如果不是一股霉味，这大狱里倒是个静思的好地方。","id":178},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#4$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"是啊。不过是在这待了一会儿，许多事情都想通了。","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"卷牍库的那把火，是你放的吧。","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"是我出现在这里给了麟少卿答案，还是你已经提前一步想通了？","id":185},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":188},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"5,-15","posto":"5,-15","duration":"0","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_041","duration":"1.5","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#9$1","posfrom":"-220,0","posto":"-220,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"又见面了，麟少卿。","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"charslot","id":201},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"喂，我这会没心情和你掰扯点心的事，我还得去救人！","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"别急，别急，你忙活的事，着急就有用了？","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你知道什么——","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我只知道，火候不到，盖揭不开的。","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"......","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"唉，天大的事不能耽误吃饭，吃不下饭，什么事都是白搭。","id":218},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","volume":"1","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"先尝尝吧，这是不是你要找的桔红酥？","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你......不是口口声声说，全百灶也找不到我要找的味道吗？","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"可我还说了，我就是百灶最厉害的厨师，只要是这世上存在过的味道，我都能复制出来。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"等一下，这是我自己做的，我们那个赌可不作数啊。","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这不就是你之前做过的桔红酥......","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"煌半信半疑，夹起了一块点心放入嘴中。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"——！","id":237},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"text","text":"这几日她尝过了不少美食，学到了不少衡量一道菜品优劣的办法。摆在眼前的糕点，算不上好吃。","id":239},{"type":"text","text":"行箸说得一点也没错，点心里放太多糖，的确会盖过桔皮的清香，过多的油也破坏了点心外面的酥皮的口感。","id":240},{"type":"text","text":"这不是一道好吃的点心......","id":241},{"type":"text","text":"但这恰恰就是她记忆中的味道。","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你为什么......","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"为什么......会做这种味道？","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你不是一直说，我做的桔红酥不够甜，我就在想，到底是哪里的厨师会这么做桔红酥。","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"后来想到，有没有可能，把这道糕点做得那么甜的人，根本不是为了好吃呢？","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"做点心不是为了好吃是指......","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你说，你是在维多利亚吃到这道点心的，对吧？","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我就是想起，好多年前，店里常来的一个客人。他总是习惯点一份桔红酥，说要寄给国外的女儿。","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我说路上太远，点心寄过去早就坏了。","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"可他偏偏不信邪，自己做了加工，又用信纸在包装上裹了一层又一层，也不知道到底是寄信还是寄点心。","id":257},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashtable","volume":"1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","id":260},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你认识他！","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"他来过这里......我一直在找他......","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你知不知道，他到底是......","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#7$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"算不上认识吧。他就是这家店很多年前的一位常客。","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"依稀记得，他常常早上天不亮的时候就过来，点一份最便宜的早餐。然后就在窗边坐着，像是在等什么人。","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"等什么人......？","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我哪知道，你自己看咯。","id":273},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":279},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"-50","yTo":"50","duration":"20","block":"false","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_animal_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"an","id":281},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"an","fadetime":"2","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"天蒙蒙亮。","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"依稀可见的圆月尚挂在天边，良宵将尽，或许很多人还沉睡在一个佳期团圆的梦里。","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"勤于生计的小贩早早出摊，悠长的吆喝响彻长街，叫醒这座偌大的城市。","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"煌看到，街角出现了一个熟悉的身影。","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"an","fadetime":"2","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"charslot","id":294},{"type":"background","id":295},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ghosthunter_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ghosthunter_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":296,"musicid":2},{"type":"image","image":"58_i06_2","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.6","yScale":"1.6","y":"-200","fadetime":"0","id":297},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"-320","xTo":"-380","duration":"10","block":"false","id":298},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":302},{"type":"image","image":"58_i06_2","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.7","yScale":"1.7","y":"-100","fadetime":"2","id":303},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"350","xTo":"410","duration":"10","block":"false","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":305},{"type":"image","image":"58_i06_2","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"3","id":306},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"10","block":"false","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"平时谁也不会注意到，这家小饭馆和那座幽深的宅邸只隔了一个街角。","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"这样的景象，他是不是已经看了好多年？","id":312},{"type":"dialog","id":313},{"type":"image","image":"58_i06_1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":314},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"是你......","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"真的是你......","id":318},{"type":"dialog","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"image","id":322},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......你在这里。","id":330},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"没想到，活着的时候，还能见到你。","id":337},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"1","id":340},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":343},{"type":"text","text":"倚坐在墙角的人衣着破落，手捧一块月饼，吃得满须满脸，全然不顾来访的客人。","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"穹顶上的铁窗漏下天光一抹，照在囚犯清癯的脸上。","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"大理寺也是厚道，这大狱里候审的犯人，中秋节都还能分一块月饼。","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"还挺好吃的，尝一块？","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkingstick_slow","volume":"1","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"不必了，眼看着将来要在这大牢里吃一阵子饭了，不差这一口。","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"可惜了，我们要唠的还多着呢，总不好干聊吧？","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"老人喉咙间挤出一声干笑，竟在穿囚服的人对面席地坐下。","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","focus":"n","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你惦记着要质问我这个老头子，惦记了几十年，今天终于如愿以偿了？","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"宁大人应该恨透了我。","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"就差一步，你就可以安心回你的老家，让你的子孙陪着你安享晚年。","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"就差这一步......哈哈哈哈哈哈。","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"这么说，我确实该恨你，我都恨不得冲上去咬下你身上一口肉来。","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"可转念一想，你为了我这个老头子，搭上了几十年的时间、大理寺少卿的官职，还有眼看着只能在这狱里度过的余生——","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"怎么看都该是你更恨我才对。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"哈哈哈哈哈......宁大人实在是多虑了。","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我早就说过了，我不是什么好官，更不是什么好人......和顾筌不一样。","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我不过是一个老饕，就喜欢闻着味找那藏得最深的真相。剥壳食肉，食髓知味。哪怕把这双手弄得鲜血淋漓，硌掉满口老牙，我也乐意。","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"这几十年里，您就是我餐桌上那只最大最肥的壳兽，我哪能恨您呢？","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"就算要恨......也不是因为我自己的事。","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你的牙口到底是好，啃下来我这块老骨头，也没见你硌掉牙。","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"可是虞澄啊虞澄，你怎么就铁了心觉得，我今天一定会来见你？","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"要是我就这么一走了之，你这么多年的苦心谋划，岂不是都付诸东流了？","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"哈哈哈哈......因为我了解你。我太了解你了，宁大人。","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我就是在赌，你在官场上沉浮数十载，你的手不干净，但你还是个人。","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"毕竟你让顾筌在你眼皮底下活了那么多年，也养了他的女儿那么多年。","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"你在意那个孩子......那两个孩子的死活。在你有生之年，你也想看到她们清清白白地在太阳底下活着......","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"你清楚，只要你一天不松口，她们就一日不得安宁。","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"所以你一定会来见我......你必须来见我。","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"这些事你都查到了......看来该查的，你早已经查得差不多了。","id":395},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"有多久了？","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"所有的线索，拼凑得七七八八，想通这案子里的每一环，不过是去年的事吧。愧为大理寺少卿，手脚实在是慢了点。","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"倒是顾筌，怕是好多年前就查得清清楚楚了吧。","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"这我确实没有想到......","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"当年他回到百灶，你把他控制在自己眼皮子底下。但没有想到，他就在你府上抄了十几年的信。","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"就通过这一封封达官显贵之间的信，他一个九品的奉礼郎，找到了当年那场血案中活下来的每一个人，抽丝剥茧，最终拼凑出了真相。","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"这个顾筌，用心深远，我还真是小瞧了他。","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"事到如今，宁大人还有什么话想说？","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈哈哈......还有什么话要说？该认的罪，我当然会认。","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"当年主理太师一案的刑部尚书，的确是我派人杀的。","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"但不是因为他指控我是太师谋逆的党羽......","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"只是因为，太师谋逆，从头到尾就是件冤案。","id":417},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":419},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":420},{"type":"charslot","id":421},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":422},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":423},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"只是有些好奇，麟少卿是何时猜到的？","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"鼎丰楼起火时，我就怀疑过那个人是你。","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"为何？我应该和那些事没有什么关系吧？","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"只是直觉。","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"就算当时你没有用你自己的武功，那蒙面人的身形和身手还是让我隐约觉得十分熟悉。","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"可后来在大理寺你主动找到我，又让我打消了这个疑虑。","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"回过头想想，早在我准备弹劾虞澄的时候，你应该就已经和他接触颇深了。我没有想到，你居然早就和虞澄有了合作。","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"从卷牍库的火到宁府的挂画，再到鼎丰楼的火，最近发生的这几件疑案，都是你在引导我去找线索？","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"情急之下，手段是着急了点。现在再看，倒有几分儿戏了。","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"那百珍宴上的火......？","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"很遗憾，那的确不是我所为，不过阴差阳错，倒也帮忙达成了我们的目的就是了。","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你们做了这么多事，究竟是为了什么？","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"说来荒唐，这一切的开始，不过是一桩不大不小的陈年旧案。","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"那是我入职肃政院后，偶然接触到的一桩案子。","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"刑部尚书，被路边乞丐当街刺杀。这样荒唐的案子，居然没头没尾地草草结案了。","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"就算那凶手已经伏法，可他的身份、行刺的动机......卷宗里有太多暧昧不明的地方。","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"当我想要进一步追查下去时，却发现所有的线索都指向了另一件更大的案子，且所有线索也都被那个案子给截断了。","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"太师谋逆案......","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"麟少卿也是调查过的。","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"三公谋逆，惊天大案，受牵连者成千上万。别说去查明真相，在那段时间，提及那位大人都是莫大的禁忌。","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"“太师使皇子弑君。”史书上只留下了这样一句话。","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"可是老真龙去世的那一晚，没有人知道究竟发生了什么。","id":463},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"城防的军队到底由谁调动，走入那座宫殿的人又是谁？","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"后来我才发现，我竟然不是唯一一个在追查这件案子的人。","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你就是这个时候认识了虞澄？","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"该说是臭味相投，还是一见如故？","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你说你们查不到线索，又如何断定太师是蒙冤的？","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"不，不是我们查到的......","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"查明这一切的人，是顾筌。","id":475},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":478},{"type":"charslot","id":479},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":481},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":482},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":483},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"为什么？","id":485},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你当真不明白为什么？","id":487},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我当然明白，我就是想问问宁大人，这个“为什么”，你亲口说出来的时候，嘴里是什么滋味？","id":489},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......民意滔滔，人心惶惶......","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"只有经历过的人才知道，炎国当下的太平图景，来之不易。","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"那确实是很久以前的事了。","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"老真龙一生勤勉，那时，源石工业改变了这片大地的格局。而他让炎国，在那个风云动荡的时代没有落后于泰拉诸国。","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"就是这样一位雄主，晚年却感染了矿石病。他认为自己时日无多，种种政举，也失之偏颇......","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"当时那位皇子有意阻止真龙......太师也站在了他那一边。","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"所谓的太师支持，是太师授意储君夺权篡位吗？","id":498},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"老真龙死在了皇子入宫劝谏的晚上，那位皇子也自此下落不明。这惊天动地的事，需要一个说法。","id":500},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......所以需要有一个人来背负这一切罪名。","id":502},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你以为，当今真龙不知道吗......？","id":504},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......哼。","id":506},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"朝局更替，人心自然动荡。“肃清逆党”，正是个合适的名号。","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"当时尚且年轻的真龙用雷霆手段，扫清了不少心怀不轨的人，用最短的时间稳定了局面，没有让这场宫廷之祸蔓延到禁城之外。","id":509},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"四十年了，我本以为，我是除真龙外，唯一一个还记得这段往事的人。","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"直到那起案子过去十几年后，那个年轻人，再次出现在了我的面前。","id":512},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"宁大人恐怕说得太轻巧了些。","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"当时被“扫清”的，不止几个乱臣贼子，还有太师全家上下，二十八人。","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"这些人尽数入狱，他们有的为了自证清白，自尽于狱中；活下来的，也都被流放。我试着去寻找过他们的踪迹，却是一个都找不到了。","id":516},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......","id":518},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":519},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"除了一个孩子......在动乱时被带走的，当时还在襁褓里的孩子。","id":520},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我没想过她还活着，也从没相信她真的已经死了。","id":522},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"看来你已经见过她了？","id":524},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"几天前见过了......长相看不出几分相似了。但是那脾性，倒真像一个模子里刻出来的。","id":526},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"顾筌在百灶十几年，到死都没有吐露关于那个孩子下落的半个字......","id":527},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"想必宁大人现在也该明白了，顾筌为什么会死在回维多利亚的路上。","id":529},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......虞澄，你这个老东西。","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你要让顾筌用自己的死，杜绝所有人找到那个孩子下落的可能，也给你一个调查我的机会。","id":532},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我那时以为，顾筌苦苦追查太师一案不得结果，心灰意冷，决定离开百灶。","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我也是过了许多年才想明白，顾筌想要的不是一个所谓的真相，你刚刚说的那些纠葛，他早在那时候，其实心里就已经有了答案。","id":535},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":536},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"他希望我做到的，是另一件事。","id":537},{"type":"dialog","id":538},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":539},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":540},{"type":"charslot","id":541},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":542},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#5$1","id":543},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":544},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":545},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":546},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":547},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":548},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我不明白......","id":549},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"难道从一开始，你们就知道煌是那场案件的遗孤？","id":550},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"麟少卿应该也已经调查到了，顾筌和虞澄，其实早就认识了。","id":552},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"顾筌自从带走那个孩子以后，将这个秘密牢牢藏了几十年，但是临终前，他将这个孩子的下落，告诉了他当时唯一的“朋友”，虞澄。","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"在顾筌死后，虞澄立即开始寻找那个孩子的下落。","id":554},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"但是当时他作为大理寺少卿，不便亲自行动，为了不引人注目，他便委托当时尚不在朝局中央的我，暗中寻访。","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"当我在维多利亚找到她时，发现她已经是一名感染者。","id":556},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"我也不能立刻将她带回百灶，为了保护她，我只好先将她送去一家救治感染者的医疗机构。","id":557},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":558},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"竟然是你......","id":559},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"原来早在那时候，你们就已经串通好了。","id":560},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":561},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"但在这个计划里，麟少卿也早就是其中的一部分了。","id":562},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":563},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这又是何意？","id":564},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":565},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"麟少卿如何能接触到煌的线索，又如何能接触到那些过去的卷宗，麟少卿应该不会觉得这些都是偶然吧？","id":566},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":567},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":568},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":569},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"虞澄不会亲自告诉你这些。这件事太冒险，这世上不能有第三个人知道。","id":570},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"但他一直在寻找一个合适的人选......一个有勇气，站在真相这一边的人。","id":571},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"虞澄早就做好了舍身的准备，我可以弄脏这双手，替他去做一些不得不为之事。","id":572},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":573},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"可是，还不够。我们还需要有一个清清白白的人，用能见得了光的手段，让这个真相重见天日。","id":574},{"type":"dialog","id":575},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":576},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":577},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"麟少卿，时候差不多了。","id":578},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"现在还有最后一个机会......","id":579},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"麟少卿，还愿不愿意让这个真相重见天日？","id":580},{"type":"dialog","id":581},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":582},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":583},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":584},{"type":"charslot","id":585},{"type":"background","id":586},{"type":"image","id":587}],"characters":["顾筌","小大厨","小厨子","宁述","宁府管家","宁府杂役","宁茵","监狱卫兵A","监狱卫兵B","谌彻","戴面具的人","麟青砚","？？？","解真","煌","虞澄"]}